    'a10': "The starting fee is 10 PLN and a kilometre costs 4 PLN on weekdays from 6:00 to 22:00. At night, on Sundays and holidays it is 6 PLN/km, out of town 8-11 PLN/km. Details and a sample fare in our <a href=\"{{U:cennik}}\">price list</a>.",
    'q11': "Can you pick me up at Rzeszów railway station?",
    'a11': "Yes. Tell us when your train or bus arrives and the driver will come to the station and help with your luggage.",
    'q12': "Can I pay by card or BLIK?",
    'a12': "Yes, in every car you can pay by card, BLIK or cash. Companies get a VAT invoice.",
