    'cen.przp': "A 6 km ride in Rzeszów on a Wednesday at 14:00 (tariff 1): 10 PLN + 6 x 4 PLN = <b>34 PLN</b>. The same ride on Saturday at 23:00 or on a Sunday (tariff 2): 10 PLN + 6 x 6 PLN = <b>46 PLN</b>. The final amount is shown by the taximeter.",
    'cq5': "How much is a kilometre by taxi in Rzeszów?",
    'ca5': "On weekdays from 6:00 to 22:00 a kilometre costs 4 PLN; at night (22:00-6:00), on Sundays and holidays 6 PLN. Out-of-town rides without return cost 8 PLN/km by day and 11 PLN/km at night. Plus a one-off starting fee of 10 PLN.",
    'cq6': "When does the night tariff apply?",
    'ca6': "Tariff 2 (6 PLN/km) applies from 22:00 to 6:00 and all day on Sundays and public holidays.",
    'cq7': "How much is a taxi from Rzeszów to nearby towns?",
    'ca7': "Out-of-town rides without return are charged at tariff 3 (8 PLN/km) or, at night, tariff 4 (11 PLN/km), plus the 10 PLN starting fee. For longer routes, ask for an individual quote.",
    'cq8': "Which is cheaper - a ride-hailing app or a taxi?",
